                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77 Chinese Eastern/411: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-10-23T15:00:00+08:00">October 23, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 23—11:40 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>922. Department’s 337, October 17, 5 p.m., third paragraph. Yes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
